# deliverables: media stays out of Git. The old `deliverables/*.mp4` matched one
# directory shallower than the real tree and let 816 MB through. The repo-wide
# patterns in the MEDIA GUARD block below cover this folder at any depth.
!deliverables/MON-DEMO26_Proof_Over_Promises_v3_1080p60_Master.mp4
!deliverables/INDEX.md


